[i]This mod was created using AI assistance. If you're against the use of AI, stay away.[/i]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/banner.jpg[/img]

Grow cannabis the way it's really done: sexed seeds, light cycles, feeding, hydroponics, breeding, cloning, drying, trimming, curing and smoking. Every step matters to the quality of what you harvest. Made by a working grower for [b]Build 42[/b], single player and multiplayer.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Yes, dedicated servers included[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Works with[/b][/td][td]Dazed Core, Power and Plumbing (all optional)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedDank[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-grow.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/stages.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Cannabis is a normal farm crop: plow, use [b]Sow Seed[/b], water, harvest. It grows indoors too.
[*]Five stages. Feed [b]Veg[/b] food in veg and [b]Bloom[/b] food in flower, once per stage; twice burns the plant.
[*]Care, light, genetics and harvest timing set the final quality.
[*][b]Inspect Cannabis Plant[/b] opens a status window with stage, water, health and warnings.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-light.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/lights.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Ceiling lamps hang indoors; flood lights stand anywhere. Both need power.
[*]Add a [b]Light Timer[/b]: [b]18/6[/b] holds plants in veg, where every extra day adds yield. Switch to [b]12/12[/b] to flower.
[*]Veg light spilling onto a 12/12 plant in its dark hours is a [b]light leak[/b]: stress, and maybe a hermie.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-bags.png[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Small and Large Grow Bags[/b] place like furniture and become plots. Fill them with potting soil once and they're reusable.
[*]Fabric forgives overwatering. A large bag gives 25% more buds.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-hydro.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/hydro.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Three systems: [b]DWC[/b] buckets, [b]RDWC[/b] with up to 6 sites on one reservoir, and [b]Ebb and Flow[/b] flood tables on a timer.
[*]Indoor only. Plants drink and eat from a reservoir: top it up, dose it, change it.
[*]A dead air pump, stale or tainted water brings [b]root rot[/b]. Catch it early: change the reservoir and treat with bleach.
[*]With [b]Dazed Plumbing[/b], pipe a reservoir to a water tank and changes refill themselves.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-breed.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/strains.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Six starter strains, each with hidden potency, yield and flowering speed. Cross two and you get a brand-new named strain.
[*]Indica, Sativa and Hybrid, each with their own look, high and genetics. About 1 seed in 10 is male.
[*]Top plants in veg for more buds, and keep an [b]XL mother pot[/b] for steady cuttings.
[*]Males show at pre-flower. [b]Pull Male Plant[/b], or keep one near your females to make seeds of the cross.
[*]Stressed females can turn [b]hermie[/b] and seed themselves and every female nearby.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-clone.png[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Take Cutting[/b] in veg or pre-flower with scissors or a knife. Dip it in [b]rooting gel[/b].
[*]Root cuttings in a [b]Cloning Dome[/b], or stick them straight in soil. Skill, gel, warmth and light raise the odds.
[*]Clones keep their mother's genetics, with a little drift each generation.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-cure.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/curing.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Hang wet plants on a [b]Drying Rack[/b]; a [b]Drying Fan[/b] helps. Leave them too long and they over-dry.
[*]Cure in a [b]Curing Jar[/b] (30 buds) or [b]Curing Barrel[/b] (300). Burp every day and a half or risk mold.
[*]Buds are named by quality: Poor, Average, Good, Premium, and [b]Top Shelf[/b] from RDWC.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-smoke.png[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Roll Joint[/b] with papers, or [b]Smoke in Pipe[/b] for a harder hit. You need a lighter or an open flame.
[*]Indica relaxes and makes you hungry; Sativa lifts your mood and wakes you up. Moldy smoke only hurts.
[*]Tolerance builds with every dose. Regular use builds dependency, and going without brings withdrawal.
[/list]

[h2]Grow rooms[/h2]
[list]
[*]Seal a room and hang a [b]Grow Room Panel[/b]: one light schedule and one dashboard for every lamp and reservoir inside.
[*]Each room has its own [b]temperature and humidity[/b]. Fans, heaters, dehumidifiers and humidifiers keep it in range.
[*]Open doors and bare windows leak light. Hang a sheet to seal them.
[/list]

[h2]Grower occupations[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Cultivation Tech[/b] reads plants 2 Agriculture levels higher and roots more cuttings.
[*][b]Budtender[/b] reads any bud in full and cures up to +15%.
[*][b]Botanist / Breeder[/b] reads strains, gets extra seeds and breeds steadier crosses.
[/list]
A [b]High Tracker[/b] window (right-click anywhere) shows your high, tolerance and dependency live.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-skill.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/skill.png[/img]
Your Agriculture level decides how much you can read from a plant, a seed or a bud.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-parts.png[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/gear.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Find seeds and gear in garden and hardware stores, farms and drug labs.
[*]Everything is craftable once learned from the [b]Grower's Handbook[/b] and [b]Hydroponics Monthly[/b] magazines.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-good.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Single player and multiplayer.
[*]30 sandbox options: growth speed, harvest size, drying and curing time, mold, lamp range, tolerance, loot, root rot, room climate, light leaks, grower occupations and more.
[*]Works with vanilla farming; cannabis counts as a houseplant.
[*]Optional: [b]Dazed Plumbing[/b] pipes reservoirs to a water tank, [b]Dazed Power[/b] runs your gear off batteries in a wired building, and [b]Dazed Core[/b] lets Dazed Climate set real room temperatures.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/DazedDank-Workshop/main/images/h-help.png[/img]
